# Design System Rules

Source: `ai-native-design-system/` — reference via `docs/design-system/`

## Before generating UI

1. Read `docs/design-system/PATTERNS.md` for the applicable pattern
2. Read `docs/design-system/COMPONENTS.md` for component specs
3. Use semantic tokens from `src/design-system/tokens/` — `$ds-*` names
4. Map to Bootstrap via `docs/design-system/BOOTSTRAP_MAPPING.md`

## Bootstrap 5.0.2

- Override via `src/design-system/bootstrap/_overrides.scss` — never edit Bootstrap source
- Prefer Bootstrap utilities over custom CSS
- Custom layout classes use `ps-` prefix only in `src/styles/globals.scss`

## Accessibility

- WCAG 2.1 AA minimum
- Semantic HTML, keyboard access, visible focus, ARIA labels on shell controls
- Source: `ai-native-design-system/foundation/accessibility/ACCESSIBILITY.md`

## Do not generate

- Engine logic (audio, ASCII rendering)
- Runtime orchestration changes unless requested
- Hardcoded hex colors in component files
